---
---
<header class="dossier-header">
  <div class="dossier-container">
    
    <div class="dossier-photo">
      <div class="photo-frame">
        <img 
          src="/images/about/profile-photo.jpg" 
          alt="Esteban Jimenez" 
          width="200"
          height="200"
        />
        <div class="scan-line"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="status-indicator">
        <span class="status-dot"></span>
        <span>CLEARANCE: TOP SECRET</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="dossier-info">
      <div class="identity-block">
        <h1 class="name">ESTEBAN JIMENEZ</h1>
        <h2 class="title">RED TEAM OPERATOR // PURPLE TEAM STRATEGIST</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="executive-summary">
        <p>
          Especialista en ciberseguridad ofensiva y defensiva con enfoque en protección de infraestructura crítica. 
          Liderazgo probado en simulaciones de adversarios (Red Team), respuesta a incidentes y 
          desarrollo de capacidades defensivas (Blue Team).
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="meta-grid">
        <div class="meta-item">
          <span class="label">LOCATION</span>
          <span class="value">Quito, Ecuador (Global Remote)</span>
        </div>
        <div class="meta-item">
          <span class="label">UNIT</span>
          <span class="value">CyberFlippers Captain</span>
        </div>
        <div class="meta-item">
          <span class="label">RANK</span>
          <span class="value">Top 1 Ecuador (HTB)</span>
        </div>
        <div class="meta-item">
          <span class="label">CONTACT</span>
          <div class="social-links">
            <a href="mailto:jimenez.francisco16@yahoo.es"><i class="fas fa-envelope"></i></a>
            <a href="https://linkedin.com/in/esteban-jimenez-994868249/" target="_blank"><i class="fab fa-linkedin"></i></a>
            <a href="https://github.com/mrflippermen" target="_blank"><i class="fab fa-github"></i></a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</header>

<style>
  .dossier-header {
    background: rgba(10, 10, 10, 0.4);
    border: 1px solid #333;
    border-left: 4px solid var(--neon-red);
    padding: 2.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 4rem;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  /* Watermark effect */
  .dossier-header::before {
    content: 'CONFIDENTIAL';
    position: absolute;
    top: 50%;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translate(-50%, -50%) rotate(-30deg);
    font-size: 8rem;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02);
    font-weight: 900;
    pointer-events: none;
    z-index: 0;
  }

  .dossier-container {
    display: flex;
    gap: 3rem;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  /* PHOTO SECTION */
  .dossier-photo {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    width: 200px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .photo-frame {
    width: 100%;
    height: 200px;
    border: 2px solid #444;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: #000;
  }

  .photo-frame img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    filter: grayscale(100%) contrast(1.2);
    transition: filter 0.5s;
  }
  
  .photo-frame:hover img {
    filter: grayscale(0%) contrast(1);
  }

  .scan-line {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 2px;
    background: var(--neon-blue);
    opacity: 0.5;
    animation: scan-vertical 4s infinite linear;
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .status-indicator {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    font-family: monospace;
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    color: var(--neon-green);
    background: rgba(0, 255, 65, 0.05);
    padding: 0.3rem 0.5rem;
    border: 1px solid rgba(0, 255, 65, 0.2);
  }

  .status-dot {
    width: 6px;
    height: 6px;
    background: var(--neon-green);
    border-radius: 50%;
    animation: blink 2s infinite;
  }

  /* INFO SECTION */
  .dossier-info {
    flex-grow: 1;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .identity-block {
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #333;
    padding-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .name {
    font-size: 2.8rem;
    font-weight: 900;
    color: #fff;
    margin: 0;
    letter-spacing: -1px;
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .title {
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: var(--neon-red);
    margin: 0.5rem 0 0 0;
    font-family: monospace;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
  }

  .executive-summary {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: #ccc;
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    max-width: 800px;
  }

  .meta-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(180px, 1fr));
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  .meta-item {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.3rem;
  }

  .label {
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    color: #666;
    font-family: monospace;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
  }

  .value {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: #fff;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .social-links {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .social-links a {
    color: #aaa;
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    transition: color 0.3s;
  }

  .social-links a:hover {
    color: var(--neon-blue);
  }

  @keyframes scan-vertical {
    0% { top: -10%; }
    100% { top: 110%; }
  }

  @keyframes blink { 
    50% { opacity: 0; }
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .dossier-container { flex-direction: column; align-items: center; text-align: center; gap: 2rem; }
    .dossier-photo { width: 160px; margin: 0 auto; }
    .status-indicator { justify-content: center; }
    .name { font-size: 2rem; }
    .meta-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 1rem; }
  }
</style>
